  "img": "icons/consumables/potions/potion-flask-corked-bubbling-green.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn to brew forbidden alchemical formulas—known as mutagens—that temporarily alter your body and mind.</p>\n<p>As a Bonus Action, you can consume a mutagen you've prepared. Each mutagen has an <strong>Effect</strong> and a <strong>Side Effect</strong>, both described in its formula. Unless a formula says otherwise, a mutagen's Effect and Side Effect last until you finish a Short or Long Rest. While one or more mutagens are affecting you, you can take a Magic action to flush them all from your system, ending their Effects and Side Effects.</p>\n<p>Your mutagens are tailored to your own biology and have no effect on other creatures. They are also unstable: a mutagen you've brewed but not yet consumed becomes inert when you finish your next Short or Long Rest.</p>\n<p>When you finish a Short or Long Rest, you can brew a number of mutagens shown in the Mutagens Brewed column of the Mutagencraft table, choosing from the formulas you know.</p>\n<table>\n<caption>Mutagencraft</caption>\n<thead><tr><th>Blood Hunter Level</th><th>Mutagens Brewed</th><th>Formulas Known</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td>3rd</td><td>1</td><td>4</td></tr>\n<tr><td>7th</td><td>2</td><td>5</td></tr>\n<tr><td>11th</td><td>2</td><td>6</td></tr>\n<tr><td>15th</td><td>3</td><td>7</td></tr>\n<tr><td>18th</td><td>3</td><td>8</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
      "chat": ""
    },
